<title>Turn Your Kaplan Test Results Into an NCLEX Study Plan</title><meta name="description" content="Upload or type in your Kaplan Integrated test results. Vexcura turns the weak areas into an NCLEX study plan on your worklist. No Kaplan login needed."><link rel="canonical" href="https://vexcura.com/kaplan-score-report-study-plan">
